/wiki/Oramond%20Marshes\">southern plains</a>, but there are more creatures and it can be split into three different subareas. It can be reached by crossing the hill <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33682,31942,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33682, 31942, 7)</a> coming either from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a> or from the southern plains (through the teleport). \n</p><p>Depending on the votes cast within the <a href=\"#/quest/rathleton-quest\">Rathleton Quest</a>, you may find a <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20Slide\">Slime Slide</a> which is a shortcut back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33703,31939,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33703, 31939, 6)</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-East_Plains\">East Plains</span></h2>\n<p>The main area contains only the weaker <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Oramond Minotaurs</a>:\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mooh%27Tah%20Warrior\"><img alt=\"Mooh'Tah Warrior\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mooh_Tah_Warrior_65f0d7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Mooh%27Tah%20Warrior\">Mooh'Tah Warrior</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">~400</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-1